| Protocol | Fasting Window | Eating Window |\
|----------|---------------|---------------|\
| 16:8 | 16 hours | 8 hours |\
| 18:6 | 18 hours | 6 hours |\
| 20:4 (Warrior) | 20 hours | 4 hours |\
| OMAD (23:1) | 23 hours | 1 hour |\
| Extended | 24-72+ hours | As needed |\
| Custom | User-defined | User-defined |\
